WEBVTT

00:00:09,230 --> 00:00:15,550
Next question. Last time you did a cheek swab, the cause tested as toxicity. You mentioned a couple

00:00:15,550 --> 00:00:21,630
tests for toxicity, but I don't remember what they are. Also, Iverbechtin didn't test

00:00:21,630 --> 00:00:28,190
for me, but Fenbenazole did. Is there anything else like Iverbechtin that works synergistically with

00:00:28,190 --> 00:00:42,670
Fenbenazole? I don't think that Iverbechtin works synergistically with Fenbenazole. So, I don't know

00:00:42,670 --> 00:00:50,830
of anything that works. The things that work synergistically with Fenbenazole are typically

00:00:51,630 --> 00:01:05,070
thought of as like curcumin, can, vitamin E, can, burberry, can, CBD, can. I don't believe

00:01:05,070 --> 00:01:15,150
Fenbenazole that Iverbechtin is a synergistic beneficial component of the Fenbenazole protocol.

00:01:15,230 --> 00:01:21,710
There are two different things. So, something that works synergistically with it is

00:01:21,710 --> 00:01:34,670
something that increases the effectiveness of one or both products. So, curcumin, for instance, can

00:01:34,670 --> 00:01:43,390
increase the effectiveness of Fenbenazole. But I don't think Iverbechtin increases the effectiveness

00:01:43,390 --> 00:01:52,110
of Fenbenazole, nor does Fenbenazole increase the effectiveness of Iverbechtin.

